// REJECTS: Unexpected token ':'. Valid alternatives: ['.']
//
// The Relational embedded-data island addresses tables as `schema.TABLE`, never as a bare
// table name: `csvTable: schema DOT table COLON rows SEMI_COLON`. The schema segment is not
// optional and there is no default.
//
// Legend elsewhere lets a default schema be elided -- `[Db]PERSON` in a relational mapping
// resolves against the default schema -- so eliding it here is the consistent-looking guess
// and the wrong one.
